  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDESA JPOs 2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDESA JPOs 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidra till genomf&#xf6;randet av Agenda 2030 genom att tillhandah&#xe5;lla personal inom prioriterade &#xe4;mnesomr&#xe5;den. 

Bidra till delm&#xe5;len inom Strategin f&#xf6;r kapacitetsutveckling, partnerskap och metoder som st&#xf6;djer Agenda 2030 f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling 2018-2022, som syftar till en bredare svensk resursbas genom att:

1) &#xd6;ka svensk representation p&#xe5; strategiska tj&#xe4;nster i internationellt utvecklingssamarbete. 

2) &#xd6;ka anv&#xe4;ndning och &#xe5;terf&#xf6;ring av svensk kompetens och erfarenhet inom internationellt utvecklingssamarbete.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser 4 Junior Professional Officers (JPO) tj&#xe4;nster som ska placeras hos olika departement och enheter inom FN sekretariatet. Insatsen bidrar till Sveriges &#xe5;tagande att bidra till genomf&#xf6;randet av Agenda 2030 genom att tillhandah&#xe5;lla personal som arbetar med och genom FN organens och V&#xe4;rldsbankens olika mandat. F&#xf6;r detta &#xe4;ndam&#xe5;l har Sverige ett n&#xe4;ra samarbete med FN:s utvecklings-, humanit&#xe4;ra- och fredsbevarande pelare med placeringar runt om i v&#xe4;rlden. 

Insatsen bidrar &#xe4;ven till Strategin f&#xf6;r kapacitetsutveckling, partnerskap och metoder som st&#xf6;djer Agenda 2030 f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling 2018-2022. 

Tj&#xe4;nsterna som ska finansieras &#xe4;r som f&#xf6;ljer:

1. Associate Expert in International Law - International Court of Justice (ICJ) - The Hague, Netherlands
2. Associate Expert in Human Rights - Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) - Guatemala City, Guatemala
3. Associate Expert in Political Affairs - Department of Political and Peacebuilding Affairs (DPPA) - New York, USA
4. Associate Expert in Humanitarian Affairs - Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs (OCHA) - Amman, Jordan 

I oktober 2020 skedde det en &#xe4;ndring av avtalet, man kom &#xf6;verens om en ytterligare JPO-position (Junior Professional Officer) vid Development Coordination Office (DCD) i Istanbul f&#xf6;r att arbeta med st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r FN:s samordning av COVID-19-responsen i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder.

Se bilagda arbetsbeskrivningar (ToR) f&#xf6;r mer information.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is for four Junior Professional Officers (JPO) positions to be placed with different department and offices of the UN Secretariat. Sweden is commited to contribute to the implementation of Agenda 2030 in developing countries by providing human resources to work with and through the diverse mandates of the UN agencies, funds and programmes as well as the World Bank. For this purpose, Sweden closely collaborates with the UNs Development, Humanitarian and Peace keeping pillars with placements around the world. 

The contribution further aims at fulfilling the Strategy for Capacity Development, Partnerships and Methods that support Agenda 2030 2018-2022. 

The positions to be funded are as follows: 

1. Associate Expert in International Law - International Court of Justice (ICJ) - The Hague, Netherlands
2. Associate Expert in Human Rights - Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) - Guatemala City, Guatemala
3. Associate Expert in Political Affairs - Department of Political and Peacebuilding Affairs (DPPA) - New York, USA
4. Associate Expert in Humanitarian Affairs - Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs (OCHA) - Amman, Jordan 

In October 2020 there was an amendment to the agreement, an additional JPO position was agreed to The Development Coordination Office (DCD) in Istanbul to work with support for the UN&#x2019;s coordination of COVID-19 response in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
